Z||000004||Alex4mula||03-27-2001||09:27 AM||||Thank you very much mrfiero for posting for me. Also thanks to Chris Moore who took the pictures & gave me the floppy. He's a great guy with a great Fiero (N* conv).<BR>Rims are 17" MAS President. I have seen a white GT here with them. Exhaust tips are BroSpeed Bonsal or something like that. <BR>I started detailing the car in January. First front trunk, then wheels, paint and finally engine & interior. I need to say that I took many many ideas from this forum, from the 3.4 to the front trunk treatment, and many of you helped me out technically. So I owe my 1st place is in great part to you guys. Thanks  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
